# PokeAPI Data Layer

- All HTTP via `client.ts` — no raw `fetch` in components
- `client.ts` is pure fetch — no TanStack Query or React hooks
- Raw API shapes in `types.ts`; UI uses view models from `mappers.ts`
- Handle 404 vs 5xx distinctly (`notFound()` vs error boundary)
- Base URL from `constants.ts` / env
- Tests mock via MSW `mocks/handlers.ts`, not by mocking `client.ts`
